{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"2. Python 101\"\n",
        "author: \"Yi-Ju Tseng\"\n",
        "format:\n",
        "  revealjs:\n",
        "    slide-number: c/t\n",
        "    show-slide-number: all\n",
        "editor: visual\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## 資料分析步驟\n",
        "\n",
        "-   **資料匯入**\n",
        "-   **資料清洗處理**\n",
        "-   **資料分析**\n",
        "-   **資料呈現與視覺化**\n",
        "\n",
        "但在分析之前，得先學會Python的基本語法\n",
        "\n",
        "# Python 101\n",
        "\n",
        "## Variable 變數設定\n",
        "\n",
        "-   使用 `=` 設定變數\n",
        "-   **變數名稱** `=` **變數內容(值)**\n",
        "-   **變數名稱1, 變數名稱2** `=` **變數內容1(值1), 變數內容2(值2)**\n"
      ],
      "id": "df473ea2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "var1 = \"test\"\n",
        "var2, var3 = \"test2\",\"test3\"\n",
        "print(var1)\n",
        "print(var2+var3)"
      ],
      "id": "8e3ef572",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Variable 變數命名規則\n",
        "\n",
        "-   不可使用**保留字**\n",
        "    -   會變色的基本上都是保留字，如`True`, `False`等，在Python有功能的字串\n",
        "-   只能由數字`0-9`、字母`A-Z` `a-z`，或是底線組成`_`，且不可以數字開頭\n",
        "-   大小寫敏感\n"
      ],
      "id": "4a0f2a02"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "True\n",
        "False"
      ],
      "id": "b94b69b7",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Function 函數使用\n",
        "\n",
        "`函數名稱`(`參數`)，如`print`(`變數或字串`)\n"
      ],
      "id": "e098e305"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "var1 = \"test\"\n",
        "print(var1)"
      ],
      "id": "65a9269e",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`函數名稱`(`參數1`,`參數2`,...)，多個參數用`,`分隔\n",
        "\n",
        "# Data Types 資料型態\n",
        "\n",
        "## Data Types 資料型態\n",
        "\n",
        "-   **文字 (text, string, character)**\n",
        "-   **數值 (numeric)**\n",
        "-   **布林變數 (Boolean, logic)**\n",
        "-   **日期 (date)**\n",
        "\n",
        "## 文字 (text, string, character)\n",
        "\n",
        "-   一般文字，使用`單引號`或`雙引號`標註，或是使用`str(文字內容)`宣告\n",
        "-   就算內容為數字，只要使用雙引號標注，或是`str`宣告，即為文字型態（除非有做轉型）\n"
      ],
      "id": "feaed100"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "text1 = \"abcd\"\n",
        "text2 = \"10\"\n",
        "text3 = str(\"xyz\")\n",
        "text4 = str(100)\n",
        "print([text1, text2, text3,text4])"
      ],
      "id": "167f60c5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 數值 (numeric)\n",
        "\n",
        "包含**整數 int**與浮點數 float等型態。\n",
        "\n",
        "**整數 int**：正數或負數，無小數點\n",
        "\n",
        "-   直接指定，或是使用`int(數值)`宣告整數\n",
        "-   若`數值`非整數，則**無條件捨去**\n",
        "-   若`數值`是文字型態，則強迫轉型\n"
      ],
      "id": "29a2bdb5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 = 10\n",
        "int2 = int(5)\n",
        "int3 = int(6.7)\n",
        "int4 = int(6.3)\n",
        "int5 = int(\"88\")\n",
        "print([int1, int2, int3, int4, int5])"
      ],
      "id": "e6692f14",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 數值 (numeric)\n",
        "\n",
        "包含整數 int與**浮點數 float**等型態。\n",
        "\n",
        "**浮點數 float**：正數或負數，有小數點的數值\n",
        "\n",
        "-   直接指定，或是使用`float(數值)`宣告整數\n",
        "-   若`數值`為整數，則**自動增加小數點**\n",
        "-   若`數值`是文字型態，則強迫轉型\n"
      ],
      "id": "6b574a38"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "float1 = float(10)\n",
        "float2 = float(6.7)\n",
        "float3 = float(\"88.8\")\n",
        "print([float1, float2, float3])"
      ],
      "id": "c46ae219",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 布林變數 (Boolean, logic)\n",
        "\n",
        "`True` or `False`\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "3cb1df0a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "a = 1 > 2\n",
        "print(a)"
      ],
      "id": "b972e026",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "fd2a0a7e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "b = 1 < 2\n",
        "print(b)"
      ],
      "id": "211411f0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## 日期 (date)\n",
        "\n",
        "Python中並無內建的日期型態，必須使用`datetime`套件，使用前要記得載入（import）\n"
      ],
      "id": "ec7eca2c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "#| eval: false\n",
        "!pip3 install datetime # install"
      ],
      "id": "e7e193ea",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "import datetime # import"
      ],
      "id": "91678fc3",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 日期 (date)\n",
        "\n",
        "當需要用載入套件的功能時，結構為：`套件名稱`.`套件功能或資料類型`（可能有多層）\n",
        "\n",
        "如`datetime`.`datetime.now()`：\n",
        "\n",
        "-   第一個datetime為套件名稱\n",
        "-   第二個為套件內資料類型，有`date`, `time`, `datetime`等，可查閱[文件](https://docs.python.org/zh-tw/3/library/datetime.html#available-types)\n",
        "-   `.now()`為更進一步的功能（取得今日的**日期物件**）\n"
      ],
      "id": "af7bfd1c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "today = datetime.datetime.now()\n",
        "print(today)"
      ],
      "id": "d70994bf",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 日期 (date)\n",
        "\n",
        "取得日期後，**日期物件**有許多內建的功能\n",
        "\n",
        "-   如`.year`，`.month`等\n",
        "-   可查閱[文件](https://docs.python.org/zh-tw/3/library/datetime.html#available-types)\n"
      ],
      "id": "8bdc03b9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(today)"
      ],
      "id": "843c9c2f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(today.year)"
      ],
      "id": "4aa5b6ae",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(today.month)"
      ],
      "id": "12f11203",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 日期 (date)\n",
        "\n",
        "也可直接新增指定日期物件，使用方法為：\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `datetime.date(年,月,日)`\n",
        "-   `datetime.datetime(年,月,日,時,分,秒)`\n",
        "-   時分秒不指定會直接使用預設值\n"
      ],
      "id": "54f72940"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "newdate = datetime.date(2025,1,23)\n",
        "print(newdate)"
      ],
      "id": "df30a336",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "newdatetime = datetime.datetime(2025,1,23,22,45,59)\n",
        "print(newdatetime)"
      ],
      "id": "364ce9b5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "newdatetime = datetime.datetime(2025,1,23)\n",
        "print(newdatetime)"
      ],
      "id": "65ab05b2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Data Types 資料型態 - Recap\n",
        "\n",
        "-   **文字 (text, string, character)**\n",
        "-   **數值 (numeric)**\n",
        "-   **布林變數 (Boolean, logic)**\n",
        "-   **日期 (date)**\n",
        "\n",
        "# Operator 運算子\n",
        "\n",
        "## Operator 運算子\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `+`加 / `-`減 / `*`乘 / `/`除\n",
        "-   `>`大於 / `<`小於 / `==`等於 / `!=`不等於\n",
        "-   `and`且 / `or`或\n",
        "\n",
        "## +加 / -減 / \\*乘 / /除\n"
      ],
      "id": "7403405d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 = 10\n",
        "int2 = int(5)\n",
        "print([int1, int2])"
      ],
      "id": "029a5d77",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "`+`加\n"
      ],
      "id": "714c96d1"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 + int2"
      ],
      "id": "004274cb",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`-`減\n"
      ],
      "id": "c8c126ed"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 - int2"
      ],
      "id": "bd1eeef6",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "`*`乘\n"
      ],
      "id": "318c8d2d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 * int2"
      ],
      "id": "d3706065",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`/`除\n"
      ],
      "id": "90b66448"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 / int2"
      ],
      "id": "e66a5a54",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## \\>大於 / \\<小於 / ==等於 / !=不等於\n"
      ],
      "id": "c229fb91"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 = 10\n",
        "int2 = int(5)\n",
        "print([int1, int2])"
      ],
      "id": "767b8c08",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "`>`大於\n"
      ],
      "id": "94fecfca"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 > int2"
      ],
      "id": "7ea9c15e",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`<`小於\n"
      ],
      "id": "21c96fa3"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 < int2"
      ],
      "id": "684232aa",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "`==` 等於\n"
      ],
      "id": "0a677d7f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 == int2"
      ],
      "id": "8b445437",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`!=`不等於\n"
      ],
      "id": "0837ade8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "int1 != int2"
      ],
      "id": "ff0a3109",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## and / or\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "`and`且\n"
      ],
      "id": "50e36c5a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "10>5 and 10>1"
      ],
      "id": "33fd7605",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "10>5 and 1>5"
      ],
      "id": "db2b06c9",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "`or`或\n"
      ],
      "id": "7e45cb18"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "10>5 or 10>1"
      ],
      "id": "0595222d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "10>5 or 1>5"
      ],
      "id": "bcc78474",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Hands-on\n",
        "\n",
        "-   宣告一個**文字** \"15\"\n",
        "-   宣告一個**數字** 10\n",
        "-   試著相加看看？是否能相加？錯誤訊息的意思是什麼？\n",
        "\n",
        "# Common Data Structure 資料結構\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common Data Structure 資料結構\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   序列 (sequence)\n",
        "    -   表 (list)\n",
        "    -   定值表 (tuple)\n",
        "    -   範圍 (range)\n",
        "-   映射 (mapping)\n",
        "    -   字典 (dist)\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   矩陣 (matrix, array)\n",
        "    -   一般矩陣\n",
        "    -   numpy矩陣\n",
        "-   資料框 (data frame)\n",
        "    -   pandas 資料框\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common Data Structure 資料結構\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   **序列 (sequence)**\n",
        "    -   表 (list)\n",
        "    -   定值表 (tuple)\n",
        "    -   範圍 (range)\n",
        "-   映射 (mapping)\n",
        "    -   字典 (dist)\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   矩陣 (matrix, array)\n",
        "    -   一般矩陣\n",
        "    -   numpy矩陣\n",
        "-   資料框 (data frame)\n",
        "    -   pandas 資料框\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## 表 (list)\n",
        "\n",
        "A collection allows us to put many values in a single “variable”\n",
        "\n",
        "-   surrounded by square brackets`[ ]`\n",
        "-   separated by commas`,`\n",
        "-   element can be *any* Python object\n",
        "-   can be empty\n",
        "-   可作運算\n"
      ],
      "id": "7b0401e9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "list1 = [3.5, 4.6, 5.7]\n",
        "print(list1)"
      ],
      "id": "86100c03",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## list and for loop\n",
        "\n",
        "依序將list結構的內容取出，設定為x，並印出來\n"
      ],
      "id": "aa9fd167"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "friends = ['Joseph', 'Glenn', 'Sally']\n",
        "for x in friends:\n",
        "    print('Happy New Year:',  x)\n",
        "print('Done!')"
      ],
      "id": "2d2d53cf",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## list 取值\n",
        "\n",
        "-   sequence包含：list, tuple, range\n",
        "-   使用中括號加上index取值`變數名稱[index]`\n",
        "-   `index`從0開始\n",
        "\n",
        "| 位置  |  1  |  2  |  3  |  4  | ... |\n",
        "|:-----:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n",
        "| index |  0  |  1  |  2  |  3  | ... |\n"
      ],
      "id": "4856d1fd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends)"
      ],
      "id": "f20c3e1d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends[0])"
      ],
      "id": "9eff7491",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends[1])"
      ],
      "id": "c158295d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends[2])"
      ],
      "id": "43513840",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## list 取值 - slice\n",
        "\n",
        "`start`:`up to but not including`\n"
      ],
      "id": "61516edd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends)"
      ],
      "id": "c83017be",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends[1:2])"
      ],
      "id": "a0279438",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends[:2])"
      ],
      "id": "27933f4d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends[:1])"
      ],
      "id": "cde1f842",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 範圍 (range)\n",
        "\n",
        "-   使用`range(數列起點,數列終點[不包含],間隔)`宣告\n",
        "-   若只有輸入一個參數，視為數列終點，起點設為預設值0\n",
        "-   若只有輸入兩個參數，則間隔設為預設值1\n"
      ],
      "id": "59416361"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "r1 = range(10)\n",
        "print(r1)"
      ],
      "id": "f2b6b2af",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "r2 = range(10,20)\n",
        "print(r2)"
      ],
      "id": "30bca002",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "r3 = range(10,20,2)\n",
        "print(r3)"
      ],
      "id": "f1f314c2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 範圍 (range)\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "28c99c29"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(r1)"
      ],
      "id": "1e00f6af",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for i in r1:\n",
        "  print(i)"
      ],
      "id": "9c9822aa",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "1b3b64a2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "print(r3)"
      ],
      "id": "9b5a5bd0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for i in r3:\n",
        "  print(i)"
      ],
      "id": "cc1626dc",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## list and for loop - range\n"
      ],
      "id": "86e3878a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "friends = ['Joseph', 'Glenn', 'Sally']\n",
        "print(len(friends))"
      ],
      "id": "cd8e309a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(range(len(friends)))"
      ],
      "id": "687bd99a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "36703ef9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for x in friends:\n",
        "    print('Happy New Year:',  x)\n",
        "print('Done!')"
      ],
      "id": "ef09bbe2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "6beadd01"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for i in range(len(friends)) :\n",
        "    friend = friends[i]\n",
        "    print(friend)\n",
        "print('Done!')"
      ],
      "id": "f82066aa",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## list 新增修改\n",
        "\n",
        "-   Lists are “mutable”\n",
        "    -   we can change an element of a list using the index operator\n"
      ],
      "id": "a33a4f14"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friends)"
      ],
      "id": "015f20e1",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "friends[0]='new friend'\n",
        "print(friends)"
      ],
      "id": "e7c6c586",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## list 新增修改 +\n",
        "\n",
        "We can create a new list by adding `+` two existing lists together\n"
      ],
      "id": "95cce387"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "friend_cs = ['Joseph', 'Glenn', 'Sally']\n",
        "friend_md = ['Alex', 'John', 'Ray']\n",
        "print(friend_cs+friend_md)"
      ],
      "id": "7e77da4d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## list 新增修改 append\n",
        "\n",
        "We can create an empty list and then add elements using the `append` method\n"
      ],
      "id": "442eadaf"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(friend_cs)"
      ],
      "id": "14d0ab08",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "friend_cs.append('Megan')\n",
        "print(friend_cs)"
      ],
      "id": "b2914e5c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## list的運算功能\n"
      ],
      "id": "9421edd3"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "list1 = [3.5, 4.6, 5.7]\n",
        "print(list1)"
      ],
      "id": "65698773",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`sum(`list物件名稱`)` 物件加總\n"
      ],
      "id": "cbe5ac30"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "sum(list1)"
      ],
      "id": "0e0ff1d2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`max(`list物件名稱`)` 物件最大值\n"
      ],
      "id": "cfbcacd2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "list1 = [3.5, 4.6, 5.7]\n",
        "max(list1)"
      ],
      "id": "05b94695",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "可參考[文件](https://docs.python.org/zh-cn/3/library/functions.html)\n",
        "\n",
        "## 定值表 (tuple)\n",
        "\n",
        "-   Like `list`...\n",
        "-   surrounded by square brackets`( )`\n",
        "-   separated by commas`,`\n",
        "-   Tuples are “immutable” --\\> *More Efficient*\n",
        "    -   No `.append()`, `.sort()`, etc\n"
      ],
      "id": "0ec53f8e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "tuple1 = (3.5, 4.6, 5.7, \"111\", \"222\")\n",
        "print(tuple1)"
      ],
      "id": "774c83fc",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 定值表 (tuple) assignment\n",
        "\n",
        "We can also put a tuple on the left-hand side of an assignment statement\n"
      ],
      "id": "479a11e5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "(x, y) = (4, 'fred')\n",
        "print(y)"
      ],
      "id": "4f1350a8",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Hands-on\n",
        "\n",
        "-   新增一sequence `a`，包含數字1到10\n",
        "-   新增一sequence `b`，包含數字1到20中的所有偶數\n",
        "-   取出`a` sequence 的第*4*個值\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common Data Structure 資料結構\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   序列 (sequence)\n",
        "    -   表 (list)\n",
        "    -   定值表 (tuple)\n",
        "    -   範圍 (range)\n",
        "-   **映射 (mapping)**\n",
        "    -   字典 (dist)\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   矩陣 (matrix, array)\n",
        "    -   一般矩陣\n",
        "    -   numpy矩陣\n",
        "-   資料框 (data frame)\n",
        "    -   pandas 資料框\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# 映射 (mapping)\n",
        "\n",
        "## 字典 Dictionaries (dist)\n",
        "\n",
        "-   Dictionaries are Python’s most powerful data collection\n",
        "-   使用大括號 `{ }`宣告\n",
        "-   內容為`key : value`的組合，並以`,`分隔\n",
        "-   key不能重複，通常為字串\n"
      ],
      "id": "c4b597e9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "dist1 = {\"id\":1, \"name\":\"Ryan\",\"age\":20, \"School\":\"NYCU\"}\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "e1c28c68",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 取值 \\[ \\]\n",
        "\n",
        "-   mapping包含：dist\n",
        "-   使用中括號加上key取值`變數名稱[key]`\n"
      ],
      "id": "b14b1fb2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "38558ec8",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1['age'])"
      ],
      "id": "55efebf2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 取值 .keys()\n",
        "\n",
        "\\[key1, key2, ...\\]\n"
      ],
      "id": "addf459e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "3937ee1f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1.keys())"
      ],
      "id": "3f49e633",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 取值 .values()\n",
        "\n",
        "\\[value1, value2, ...\\]\n"
      ],
      "id": "bd881795"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "e60d4487",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1.values())"
      ],
      "id": "468f2f53",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 取值 .items()\n",
        "\n",
        "\\[(key1, value1), (key2, value2),...\\]\n"
      ],
      "id": "5c89835a"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "e914a3a4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1.items())"
      ],
      "id": "2b065bb4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 新增修改 .update()\n",
        "\n",
        "-   mapping包含：dist\n",
        "-   `mapping物件.update()`可新增或修改內容(key:value pairs)至mapping中\n"
      ],
      "id": "c25450fa"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "04f6bd47",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "dist1.update({\"age\":25, \"dept\":\"CS\"})\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "d4496e24",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 新增修改 \\[ \\]\n",
        "\n",
        "`[ ]`取值後寫回\n"
      ],
      "id": "6484d5a8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "14c609af",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "dist1['age']=dist1['age']+10\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "6b081bdd",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## mapping 新增修改 .get()\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `.get(key, 0)` 取值\n",
        "    -   key: key\n",
        "    -   0: any default value\n"
      ],
      "id": "b70b8560"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "90a95709",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "dist1['age']=dist1.get('age', 0)+10\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "f9e9b50f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Hands-on\n",
        "\n",
        "-   新增一mapping `dist1`，內容為\n"
      ],
      "id": "8e823268"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "dist1 = {\"id\":[1,2,3,4], \n",
        "        \"name\":[\"Ryan\",\"Tom\",\"Emma\",\"Amy\"], \n",
        "        \"School\":\"NYCU\"}"
      ],
      "id": "a4f5a32d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "-   取出`id`中的第*3*個值\n",
        "-   取出`name`中的第*2*個值的第1個字元（字母）\n",
        "\n",
        "## mapping + for\n",
        "\n",
        "-   mapping結構（dist）預設取得部份為key\n",
        "-   使用`.values()`即可取value (值)\n"
      ],
      "id": "a8d5beee"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "0b5aa863",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "Key\n"
      ],
      "id": "ae8052cb"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for i in dist1:\n",
        "  print(i)"
      ],
      "id": "27d129b4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "Value\n"
      ],
      "id": "a539c680"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for i in dist1.values():\n",
        "  print(i)"
      ],
      "id": "0b1e2044",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## mapping + for - key and value\n"
      ],
      "id": "bc3ab87b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(dist1)"
      ],
      "id": "6db74c83",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "先得到key，再取得value\n"
      ],
      "id": "b55f8859"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for key in dist1:\n",
        "  print(key, dist1[key])"
      ],
      "id": "efff2737",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "或是直接使用`.items()`\n"
      ],
      "id": "b9445e7d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "for key,value in dist1.items():\n",
        "  print(key, value)"
      ],
      "id": "8eb15e19",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Hands-on\n",
        "\n",
        "Most Common Name? Edit the ???? parts\n"
      ],
      "id": "bd074f50"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "names = ['csev', 'cwen', 'csev', 'zqian', 'cwen']"
      ],
      "id": "e36db948",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Use dist and for to get the most common name and its count\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "aed72fd4"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "#| eval: false\n",
        "names = ['csev', 'cwen', 'csev', 'zqian', 'cwen']\n",
        "counts = dict()\n",
        "for name in ??? : # edit here\n",
        "    if name not in counts: \n",
        "      counts[name] = ??? # edit here\n",
        "    else :\n",
        "      ??? # edit here\n",
        "print(counts)"
      ],
      "id": "65a9f789",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "63f5d66b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "#| eval: false\n",
        "names = ['csev', 'cwen', 'csev', 'zqian', 'cwen']\n",
        "counts = dict()\n",
        "for name in ??? : # edit here\n",
        "    counts[name] = ??? + 1 # edit here\n",
        "print(counts)"
      ],
      "id": "6b6cf606",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common Data Structure 資料結構\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   序列 (sequence)\n",
        "    -   表 (list)\n",
        "    -   定值表 (tuple)\n",
        "    -   範圍 (range)\n",
        "-   映射 (mapping)\n",
        "    -   字典 (dist)\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   **矩陣 (matrix, array)**\n",
        "    -   一般矩陣\n",
        "    -   numpy矩陣\n",
        "-   資料框 (data frame)\n",
        "    -   pandas 資料框\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## 一般矩陣 (matrix, array)\n",
        "\n",
        "-   可想成sequence (1維矩陣)的堆疊\n",
        "-   sequence為row的組成\n",
        "-   直接以中括號分隔matrix的row和column\n",
        "\n",
        "| Col1 | Col2 | Col3 |\n",
        "|:----:|:----:|:----:|\n",
        "|  1   |  2   |  3   |\n",
        "|  4   |  5   |  6   |\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "4cd443a9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "matrix1 = [[1, 2, 3], \n",
        "          [4, 5, 6]]\n",
        "print(matrix1)"
      ],
      "id": "35cd2926",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "62d6b96f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "row1 = [1, 2, 3]\n",
        "row2 = [4, 5, 6]\n",
        "matrix2 = [row1, row2]\n",
        "print(matrix2)"
      ],
      "id": "e7669baa",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## numpy矩陣 - 1維\n",
        "\n",
        "-   1維的情況下跟**List**很像，但是運算速度更快\n",
        "-   可用sequence新增numpy矩陣\n"
      ],
      "id": "7c1fc95b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "a = np.array([0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0]) \n",
        "list_string = ['a', 'b', 'c']\n",
        "b = np.array(list_string) \n",
        "print([a,b])"
      ],
      "id": "fc148430",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "或是用`arrange(起點,終點,間隔)`來生成numpy矩陣，如同`range()`的用法\n"
      ],
      "id": "5ffff8b9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "c = np.arange(0, 10, 2) \n",
        "print(c)"
      ],
      "id": "2db1d694",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## numpy矩陣 - 2維\n",
        "\n",
        "-   可用兩個sequence組合新增numpy矩陣\n",
        "-   預設以row為維度堆疊\n"
      ],
      "id": "5e3e7509"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "tow_d = np.array([row1,row2]) \n",
        "print(tow_d)"
      ],
      "id": "1771bcc2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## numpy矩陣 - 取值\n"
      ],
      "id": "68694d1b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d)"
      ],
      "id": "cfd28acd",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "-   使用中括號`[`index`]`取值\n",
        "-   可用slice功能，`1:`為從1開始到最後，`:2`為從0開始2到2（不包括2）\n"
      ],
      "id": "f0891e35"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d[1:])"
      ],
      "id": "b3cd7631",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d[:2])"
      ],
      "id": "cb0bbd30",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column\n",
        "-   一個維度一個`[]`，前row後column\n",
        "-   `array`\\[`row`\\]\\[`column`\\]\n"
      ],
      "id": "ee757446"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d[1][2])"
      ],
      "id": "76481169",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## numpy矩陣 - 新增修改\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `np.concatenate(`想結合的numpy矩陣list`)`\n",
        "-   一維矩陣直接往後貼\n"
      ],
      "id": "2121d58d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "np1 = np.array([0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0]) \n",
        "np2 = np.array([0, 5, 10, 15, 20]) \n",
        "new_np = np.concatenate([np1, np2])\n",
        "print(new_np)"
      ],
      "id": "c6fe428f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## numpy矩陣 - 新增修改 2維\n",
        "\n",
        "2維矩陣可決定新增方向\n",
        "\n",
        "-   `np.row_stack([np1,np2])` 使用新增row的想法組合\n",
        "-   `np.column_stack([np1,np2])` 使用新增column的想法組合\n"
      ],
      "id": "027c3d0e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "np.row_stack([np1,np2])"
      ],
      "id": "d8a53f34",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "np.column_stack([np1,np2])"
      ],
      "id": "6ea8fcd7",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## numpy矩陣 - 計算功能\n",
        "\n",
        "`sum()`、`mean()`、`std()`、`cumsum()`、`max()`、`min()`、`count()`\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "036827e7"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(a)"
      ],
      "id": "ed93bf44",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(a.sum())"
      ],
      "id": "0e1e04cc",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(a.mean())"
      ],
      "id": "ef1d79c5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(a.std())"
      ],
      "id": "72dbf757",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(a.cumsum())"
      ],
      "id": "13fd8145",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "5e5a0ccf"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d)"
      ],
      "id": "2d2c8142",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.sum()) "
      ],
      "id": "2ee5d291",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.mean()) "
      ],
      "id": "8d7c6ce9",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.std()) "
      ],
      "id": "83617d58",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.cumsum()) "
      ],
      "id": "4799d061",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## numpy矩陣 - 計算功能\n",
        "\n",
        "`sum()`、`mean()`、`std()`、`cumsum()`、`max()`、`min()`、`count()`\n",
        "\n",
        "`axis`= 0 BY COLUMN, 1 BY ROW\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "a2b0d22f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d)"
      ],
      "id": "94d0fc49",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.sum(axis=0))"
      ],
      "id": "1f6524d5",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.sum(axis=1))"
      ],
      "id": "6364f699",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: column"
      ],
      "id": "a257f5d5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.mean(axis=0))"
      ],
      "id": "8879ce53",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "print(tow_d.mean(axis=1))"
      ],
      "id": "27ac68c0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common Data Structure 資料結構\n",
        "\n",
        "::::: columns\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   序列 (sequence)\n",
        "    -   表 (list)\n",
        "    -   定值表 (tuple)\n",
        "    -   範圍 (range)\n",
        "-   映射 (mapping)\n",
        "    -   字典 (dist)\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "-   矩陣 (matrix, array)\n",
        "    -   一般矩陣\n",
        "    -   numpy矩陣\n",
        "-   **資料框 (data frame)**\n",
        "    -   pandas 資料框\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## pandas 資料框\n",
        "\n",
        "-   使用前須載入`import pandas as pd`\n",
        "-   增加欄位名稱等資訊，並提供不少資料處理功能\n",
        "-   由dict組成\n"
      ],
      "id": "dc70378f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "df1 = pd.DataFrame({\"ID\":[1, 2, 3, 4],\n",
        "                    \"Name\":[\"Tom\",\"Emma\",\"Ryan\",\"Amy\"]})\n",
        "df1"
      ],
      "id": "48404121",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## pandas 資料框 - 取值\n",
        "\n",
        "資料框物件名稱.`head(資料筆數)`：取前幾筆\n"
      ],
      "id": "054ea2a2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "df1.head(2)"
      ],
      "id": "3e4872ae",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "資料框物件名稱.`head(資料筆數)`：取後幾筆\n"
      ],
      "id": "fe4ddb6f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "df1.tail(2)"
      ],
      "id": "a7bc665f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## pandas 資料框 - 取值 (column)\n",
        "\n",
        "資料框物件名稱`[`欄位名稱`]`：取出sequence\n"
      ],
      "id": "74adbbe2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "df1[\"Name\"]"
      ],
      "id": "aa4bd8fe",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "資料框物件名稱`[[`欄位名稱`]]`：取出資料框\n"
      ],
      "id": "6bc96466"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "df1[[\"Name\"]]"
      ],
      "id": "3cee09e8",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## pandas 資料框 - 取值 (row)\n",
        "\n",
        "資料框物件名稱`[`row slice`]`\n"
      ],
      "id": "e8624198"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "df1[0:1]"
      ],
      "id": "5743efdd",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Hands-on\n",
        "\n",
        "-   使用Google生成式AI，請他生成一個儲存學生學號、姓名、成績的pandas資料框，並生成5筆資料\n",
        "-   試著取出學生成績欄位\n",
        "-   試著取出學生姓名與成績兩個欄位\n",
        "-   試著取出第3位學生的成績 (hint: sequence)\n",
        "\n",
        "## pandas 資料框 - 設定index\n",
        "\n",
        "預設index為0\\~n的序列\n"
      ],
      "id": "82e6668b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "df_index = pd.DataFrame({\"ID\":[1, 2, 3, 4],\n",
        "       \"Name\":[\"Tom\",\"Emma\",\"Ryan\",\"Amy\"]},index=[\"a\",\"b\",\"c\",\"d\"])\n",
        "df_index"
      ],
      "id": "2ccc3179",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## pandas 資料框 - 設定index\n",
        "\n",
        "也可用已有的data frame設定，透過`.set_index(欄位名稱)`\n"
      ],
      "id": "d1a2b568"
    },
